00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:39.639
27th and 28th, and yes, NerdCon: Stories is
still a thing that's going to be happening

00:03:39.639 --> 00:03:41.739
October 9th and 10th in Minneapolis.

00:03:41.739 --> 00:03:45.040
Post-VidCon, we've been doing a lot of talking
and planning about NerdCon: Stories and I'm

00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:46.269
really excited about it.

00:03:46.269 --> 00:03:49.090
We've sold most of the tickets, but not all
of them.

00:03:49.090 --> 00:03:50.090
Okay.

00:03:50.090 --> 00:03:50.091
Goodbye.

